# Secrets — never commit. Keys live in the shell env and in GitHub Actions Secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local scratch
scratch/
*.local.json

# NOTE: HALT is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the kill switch, and GitHub
# Actions runs are stateless — the file only survives between ticks by being
# committed. Same reason data/journal.jsonl is committed.

# The SQLite read model IS ignored, for the opposite reason. It holds no fact
# that data/journal.jsonl does not — `python store.py --rebuild` reproduces it
# exactly — so committing it would put a binary blob in the path five people
# rebase through while the Actions cron pushes the journal several times a day.
# JSONL merges; a .db file does not. If this file is ever committed, the
# journal has stopped being the single source of truth.
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm

.gstack/

# Local tooling scratch state -- never publishable. .memsearch holds a
# machine-local vector index plus session-transcript summaries that carry
# absolute home-directory paths and transcript UUIDs from whoever ran it.
# It served no purpose in the repo and this one is going public.
.memsearch/

# --- Agent and tooling state -------------------------------------------
# Written by whatever assistant a teammate happens to run, at whatever
# depth they run it from -- .omc/ already appears at the repo root AND
# inside deck/. No leading slash, so this matches at any depth.
.omc/

# Claude Code writes per-machine permission overrides here. The shared
# .claude/settings.json IS committed on purpose (it is the read-only
# allowlist the whole team relies on); the .local. one is personal.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Build artifacts ----------------------------------------------------
# deck/: LaTeX intermediates. theta-gate.pdf itself IS committed -- it is a
# submission deliverable and teammates and judges need it without a TeX
# install. Same for cover/cover.png. Everything below regenerates.
deck/*.aux
deck/*.log
deck/*.nav
deck/*.out
deck/*.snm
deck/*.toc
deck/*.vrb
deck/build/
